{"slug":"tayutama-kiss-on-my-deity","ad":"Tayutama: Kiss on My Deity","adEn":null,"yil":2009,"puan":62,"format":"TV","durum":"FINISHED","sezon":"SPRING","sure":23,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1094/153283.jpg","banner":null,"ozet":"Yuuri Mito is a typical, normal Japanese teenager. He goes to school, works on people's motorcycles and performs exorcisms. Okay, that last part's a little bit unusual, but his family lives in a shrine and they do that sort of thing. Still, you would think he'd know enough to be careful with an ancient relic he finds in the woods, especially when a mysterious goddess appears and tells him to leave it alone. Unfortunately, despite Mito's best efforts, the seal gets broken anyway and a number of dangerous \"tayuti\" that it held in stasis get loose. This is bad. Mito also ends up with a beautiful goddess girl who decides that she's going to marry him. This might not be so bad. if he wasn't already caught up in the middle of a war between the entities he's released. The flesh may be weak but the spirit's more than willing to compensate. \n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","turler":["Aksiyon","Komedi","Dram","Romantik","Doğaüstü"],"iliski":[{"t":"SIDE_STORY","s":null,"ad":"Tayutayu: Pure my heart","p":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/6705.jpg","f":"SPECIAL"}],"seri":null,"fragman":{"site":"youtube","id":"CjG8v21hLko"},"yasal":[],"kaynakSayisi":40,"bolumSayisi":12,"bolumler":[{"n":1,"no":"1","ad":"Tayutama - Kiss on my Deity 1. Bölüm","slug":"tayutama-kiss-on-my-deity-1-bolum","ks":3,"ekip":[{"g":"Varsayılan","e":null}],"src":[["MAIL",null,"https://my.mail.ru/video/embed/2444636457931908420","ok"],["SIBNET",null,"https://video.sibnet.ru/shell.php?videoid=1083440"],["SIBNET",null,"https://video.sibnet.ru/shell.php?videoid=4537940"]]},{"n":2,"no":"2","ad":"Tayutama - Kiss on my Deity 2. Bölüm","slug":"tayutama-kiss-on-my-deity-2-bolum","ks":3,"ekip":[{"g":"Varsayılan","e":null}],"src":[["MAIL",null